# schema_changes.log

[2025-05-04] Added qc_lookup_view
- Created a view to simplify querying QC data
- The view combines data from the qc, manufacture, qc_analyte, and analyte tables
- This allows for easier access to QC lookup functionality
- Updated schema.sql to include the new view
- No data migration needed since app is still in early development

[2025-05-04] Added qc_analyte_lookup_view

[2025-05-04] Refactored assay_lookup_view
- Updated the assay_lookup_view to include additional fields for better data retrieval
- Added fields for assay_name and spot_number

[2025-05-01] Added assay_lookup_view
- Created a view to simplify querying assay data
- The view combines data from the assay, analyte, and kit tables
- This allows for easier access to assay lookup functionality 
- Updated schema.sql to include the new view
- No data migration needed since app is still in early development

[2025-05-01] Removed assay_id from kit table; created assay_kit table
- Normalized many-to-many relationship between assays and kits
- Updated schema.sql accordingly
- No data migration needed since app is still in early development

[2025-04-15] Added qc and qc_analyte tables
- Created qc table to store quality control information
- Created qc_analyte table to store analyte-specific QC information
- Updated schema.sql to reflect new tables
- Added foreign key constraints to ensure data integrity
- No data migration needed since app is still in early development

